/bin/
/.tools/
*.exe
# Local session settings stay local, but the skill ships: it is the only thing
# that tells a model these tools exist. A blind test proved the point — an agent
# given a real image task reached for Python and hand-rolled its own metrics,
# not because it judged our tools inferior but because nothing told it they were
# there. A tool nobody is told about does not exist.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
/tmp/
